    "🖼️ A new images tab gives you a fast overview of all your content. Images from boxes and items are shown together so searching is easier." : {
      "comment" : "A new images tab gives you a fast overview of all your content. Images from boxes and items are shown together so searching is easier.",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
